and Denmark, were invited. Sweden had also finished second at the 1952 championships, which were held briefly before the Olympics. In rainy conditions, in front of a poorly filled Olympic Stadium, the Swedes defeated the Danes, 19-11. The demonstration did not help to bring back handball as an Olympic sport soon; it would only return 20 years later at the Munich Olympics."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button410301", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button410301').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Goals"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-9000698"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Sweden"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "19"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000698 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902158"} "Rune Nilsson"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "0"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000698 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902165"} "Rolf Zachrisson"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000698 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902163"} "Sven-Olof Schönberger"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "0"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-9000698 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href 